cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the repository and the exact version or
  commit you used.
title: "Memory ATE PAT Platform"
type: software
version: 8.0.0
authors:
  - name: "Xiaomiju-x"
  - name: "Memory ATE PAT Platform Contributors"
abstract: >-
  An open-source memory-device ATE test and PAT generation platform containing
  the completed AT24C02 preliminary-round system and the competition-tuned
  BY25Q40AL Southwest regional-round generator, plus the open-source
  national-finals multi-device PAT platform v1.0.9. The team received First
  Prize in the Southwest regional stage and First Prize in the National
  Finals.
repository-code: https://github.com/Xiaomiju-x/memory-ate-pat-platform
url: https://github.com/Xiaomiju-x/memory-ate-pat-platform
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - automatic test equipment
  - semiconductor testing
  - memory testing
  - PAT vector generation
  - I2C EEPROM
  - SPI NOR flash
